start     "recite"
paragraph "recite turns text into verified speech. It reads a file, renders each chunk, and checks every take with a transcription before it keeps it."
section   "Install"
paragraph "Or build it from source with make build."
section   "Usage"
paragraph "Write some text."
list-item "Run recite say -f notes.md."
list-item "Listen to notes.wav."
paragraph "See the design notes for details & caveats. Visit https://example.com."
